-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §93: §67 applies to a first deputy on a
-- change of the school's complexity, "principal" read as "first deputy",
-- the complexity supplement by the first deputies' table.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT `67`

§ `93 שינוי בשכר של סגן מנהל ראשון כתוצאה משינוי רמת מורכבות בית הספר`

@ref akn:art_93
GIVEN `supplement in each year so far` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      `the new level's supplement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a first deputy's supplement after a fall` `supplement in each year so far` `the new level's supplement` IS
    `the supplement after a fall` `supplement in each year so far` `the new level's supplement`

-- The first deputies' supplements are three-quarters of the principals'
-- (§92(א)): §67's first example at 75% gives 75% of its 1,705.20.
#ASSERT `a first deputy's supplement after a fall` (LIST 1827, 1827, 1827, 1827) 913.5 EQUALS 0.75 TIMES 1705.2
